  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together zesty seasoning, olive oil, garlic powder, and lime juice.",
    "Add chicken, glassy onions, and cilantro to the bowl. Toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread chicken and onions onto the skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until the chicken is cooked through and the onions are tender.",
